abstract: >-
  An open ride-hailing fare and market-clearing framework that uses a
  cost-grounded normal tariff and a sealed-bid fallback when the baseline
  fare does not attract a driver.
keywords:
  - ride-hailing
  - mobility
  - pricing
  - transport economics
  - sealed bidding
  - fare design
